        <mxCell id="note-paths" value="What each path carries:&lt;br&gt;- On-board link: ControllerCommands to the car; ControllerOutputs back.&lt;br&gt;- Track circuit: commanded speed and authority.&lt;br&gt;- Rails: grade, elevation, speed limit and polarity in; block, offset and speed out.&lt;br&gt;- Transponder: station name, platform side, underground.&lt;br&gt;- Passenger boarding: passengers boarded; passenger capacity back." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
